# mix-of-capabilities §8.1 P0 — 01×08 lingua × accesso: la stessa entita' e la
# stessa faccetta, chieste in lingue, grafie e tempi diversi, sui fatti veri
# della KB viva (color_of, author) e sulle lezioni lessicali salvate.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test the same color fact in english and italian]
!timeout 30
> what color is blood?
< Red.
> what colour is grass?
< Green.
!set PARROT0_LANG=it
> di che colore è il sangue?
<~ Rosso
!set PARROT0_LANG=en

[test the same authorship fact in the past, the perfect and in italian]
!timeout 30
> who wrote hamlet?
<~ William shakespeare
> who has written the odyssey?
<~ Homer
!set PARROT0_LANG=it
> chi ha scritto amleto?
<~ William shakespeare
!set PARROT0_LANG=en

[test a thing with no color fact is still not given one]
!timeout 30
> what color is zorblat?
<! Red

[test a value of a relation with a declared value class fits the asked type]
!timeout 30
> what currency does ghana use?
<~ Cedi
> what currency is used in japan?
<~ Yen

[test the language of a country is the country's language, not a programming language]
!timeout 30
> what language does brazil speak?
<~ Portuguese
<! python
> what language is spoken in japan?
<~ Japanese

[test the language of a country asked with the relation noun]
!timeout 30
> what is the language of japan?
<~ Japanese
